{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-112-1","title":"Psalms 112:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":112,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":112,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Godliness has the promises of this life, 4 and of the life to come. 10 The prosperity of the godly shall be an eyesore to the wicked.</p>\n<p>Praise ye the Lord. Heb. Hallelujah. 111:1; 147:1; 148:11-14; 150:1 This is another of the alphabetical Psalms, being formed exactly as the preceding in the division of its verses; and, like it, was probably composed for the use of the Jews, after their return from captivity.</p>\n<p>Blessed. 111:10; 115:7-13; 128:1; 145:19; Isa 50:10; Lu 1:50 delighteth. 1:1,2; 40:8; 119:16,35,47,48,70-72,97,143; Ro 7:22; 8:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-112-2","title":"Psalms 112:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":112,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":112,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>25:13; 37:26; 102:28; Ge 17:7; 22:17,18; Pr 20:7; Jer 32:39; Ac 2:39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-112-3","title":"Psalms 112:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":112,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":112,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Wealth. Pr 3:16; 15:6; Isa 33:6; Mt 6:33; 2Co 6:10; Php 4:18,19; 1Ti 6:6-8 and his. 9; 111:3,10; Isa 32:17; 51:8; Mt 24:22-24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-112-4","title":"Psalms 112:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":112,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":112,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>there ariseth. 37:6; 97:11; Job 11:17; Isa 50:10; 58:10; Mic 7:8,9; Mal 4:2 Joh 12:46 he is gracious. 106:1; Lu 6:36; 2Co 8:8,9; Eph 4:32; 5:1,2,9,15; Col 3:12,13 righteous. Tit 2:11,12; 1Jo 2:29; 3:7,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-112-5","title":"Psalms 112:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":112,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":112,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>good. Pr 2:20; 12:2; Lu 23:50; Ac 11:24; Ro 5:7 sheweth. 37:25,26; De 15:7-10; Job 31:16-20; Lu 6:35 he will. Pr 17:18; 18:9; 22:26,27; 24:27,30-34; 27:23-27; Joh 6:12; Ro 12:11 Eph 5:15; Col 4:5 discretion. Heb. judgement. Php 1:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-112-6","title":"Psalms 112:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":112,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":112,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>Surely. 15:5; 62:2,6; 125:1; 2Pe 1:5-11 the righteous. Ne 13:22,31; Pr 10:7; Mt 25:34-40; Heb 6:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-112-7","title":"Psalms 112:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":112,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":112,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>shall not. 27:1-3; 34:4; 56:3,4; Pr 1:33; 3:25,26; Lu 21:9,19 heart. 57:7; 118:6; Isa 26:3,4; Da 3:16; Ac 20:24; 21:13 trusting. 62:8; 64:10; 118:8,9; Joh 14:1; Ac 27:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-112-8","title":"Psalms 112:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":112,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":112,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>heart. 27:14; 31:24; Heb 13:9 shall. Pr 3:33 until he. 59:10; 91:8; 92:11; 118:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-112-9","title":"Psalms 112:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":112,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":112,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>He. 2Co 9:9 dispersed. De 15:11; Pr 11:24,25; 19:17; Ec 11:1,2,6; Isa 32:8; 58:7,10 Mr 14:7; Lu 11:41; 12:33; 18:22; Joh 13:29; Ac 4:35; 20:35; Ro 12:13 2Co 8:9; 9:10-15; 1Ti 6:18; Heb 13:16; Jas 2:15,16; 1Jo 3:16-18 righteousness. 3; De 24:13; Mt 6:4; Lu 14:12-14; 16:9; Heb 6:10; Re 22:11 horn. 75:10; 92:10; 1Sa 2:1,30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-112-10","title":"Psalms 112:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":112,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":112,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>wicked. Es 6:11,12; Isa 65:13,14; Lu 13:28; 16:23 gnash. 37:12; Mt 22:13; Re 16:10,11 melt. 58:7,8 desire. Pr 10:28; 11:7; Lu 16:24-26</p>"}]}